g- and plugin-driven terminal AI coding agent supporting multiple models (DeepSeek, Codex/OpenAI, MiniMax, GLM). A multi-model rewrite of deepseek-reasonix, distributed as a single static Go binary with prefix caching for low token costs across long sessions.\",\n    \"release_date\": \"2026-06-02\",\n    \"category\": \"AI coding CLI\",\n    \"sources\": [\"GitHub\"],\n    \"community_quotes\": []\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"DMX\",\n    \"url\": \"https://github.com/deepmodel-ai/dmx\",\n    \"description\": \"Official implementation of the AI SDLC — developer workflow orchestration via MCP (Model Context Protocol) for complete development lifecycle automation.\",\n    \"release_date\": \"2026-06-02\",\n    \"category\": \"workflow agent\",\n    \"sources\": [\"GitHub\"],\n    \"community_quotes\": []\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"inline\",\n    \"url\": \"https://github.com/kavishsathia/inline\",\n    \"description\": \"Inline comments from an AI coding agent to your IDE. Designed for developers who prefer IDE integration over terminal-based AI coding agents or desktop apps.\",\n    \"release_date\": \"2026-06-02\",\n    \"category\": \"IDE plugin\",\n    \"sources\": [\"GitHub\"],\n    \"community_quotes\": []\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"AI-CLI (Web IDE)\",\n    \"url\": \"https://github.com/wait4xx/AI-CLI\",\n    \"description\": \"Run Terminal or AI coding assistants (Claude Code, Aider, etc.) on your phone/tablet — a responsive web IDE with terminal, split-pane editor, file browser, and real-time collaboration capabilities.\",\n    \"release_date\": \"2026-06-01\",\n    \"category\": \"AI IDE\",\n    \"sources\": [\"GitHub\"],\n    \"community_quotes\": []\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Darwincode\",\n    \"url\": \"https://github.com/femboypig/darwincode\",\n    \"description\": \"The open source terminal AI coding agent. Build, edit, debug, and run code autonomously from terminal with full repository awareness.\",\n    \"release_date\": \"2026-06-01\",\n    \"category\": \"AI coding CLI\",\n    \"sources\": [\"GitHub\"],\n    \"community_quotes\": []\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Pao\",\n    \"url\": \"https://github.com/gmlwo530/pao\",\n    \"description\": \"macOS-first terminal AI coding agent orchestrator for local AI CLIs with management capabilities for coordinating multiple terminal-based AI agents.\",\n    \"release_date\": \"2026-06-01\",\n    \"category\": \"AI coding CLI\",\n    \"sources\": [\"GitHub\"],\n    \"community_quotes\": []\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"TerminalMind\",\n    \"url\": \"https://github.com/dhruv-005/TerminalMind\",\n    \"description\": \"Free, open-source, CLI-based AI coding agent that runs on any device. Built with LangChain, RAG, and MCP Protocol. No subscription, no cloud dependency.\",\n    \"release_date\": \"2026-06-01\",\n    \"category\": \"AI coding CLI\",\n    \"sources\": [\"GitHub\"],\n    \"community_quotes\": []\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"openclaw-devops-copilot\",\n    \"url\": \"https://github.com/m-aboud/openclaw-devops-copilot\",\n    \"description\": \"DevOps Copilot: an AI-powered assistant for DevOps workflows, infrastructure as code generation, and SRE tasks. Helps orchestrate complex development operations workflows.\",\n    \"release_date\": \"2026-06-01\",\n    \"category\": \"workflow agent\",\n    \"sources\": [\"GitHub\"],\n    \"community_quotes\": []\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Ultracode\",\n    \"url\": \"https://github.com/KangarooKi/Ultracode\",\n    \"description\": \"Local AI-assisted coding CLI inspired by Claude Code. Runs agentic coding workflows with OpenAI-compatible models, function-calling tools, task planning, memory, permissions, hooks, background commands, MCP integration, and subagent support. Features interactive REPL and one-shot modes.\",\n    \"release_date\": \"2026-05-31\",\n    \"category\": \"AI coding CLI\",\n    \"sources\": [\"GitHub\"],\n    \"community_quotes\": []\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Sharrowkin IDE\",\n    \"url\": \"https: