n for AI-assisted development.\",\n    \"release_date\": \"2026-05-30\",\n    \"category\": \"AI IDE\",\n    \"sources\": [\"GitHub\"],\n    \"community_quotes\": []\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"WorkFlowX\",\n    \"url\": \"https://github.com/TreeX-X/WorkFlowX\",\n    \"description\": \"Multi-agent orchestration framework for AI-driven development — from requirement to code to evaluation in one workflow.\",\n    \"release_date\": \"2026-05-30\",\n    \"category\": \"workflow agent\",\n    \"sources\": [\"GitHub\"],\n    \"community_quotes\": []\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Self-HealOps\",\n    \"url\": \"https://github.com/amitdevx/Self-HealOps\",\n    \"description\": \"AI-powered autonomous DevOps platform that detects CI/CD failures, performs root cause analysis using NVIDIA NIM, generates remediation plans, validates fixes, and creates automated recovery workflows.\",\n    \"release_date\": \"2026-05-30\",\n    \"category\": \"workflow agent\",\n    \"sources\": [\"GitHub\"],\n    \"community_quotes\": []\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"review-forge\",\n    \"url\": \"https://github.com/vikingmute/review-forge\",\n    \"description\": \"An Agent Skill for structured, auditable code review workflows. Provides workflow-specific code review capabilities for AI coding agents with proper audit trails.\",\n    \"release_date\": \"2026-05-29\",\n    \"category\": \"workflow agent\",\n    \"sources\": [\"GitHub\"],\n    \"community_quotes\": []\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"ai-refactor-playbook-runner\",\n    \"url\": \"https://github.com/oleg-koval/ai-refactor-playbook-runner\",\n    \"description\": \"Markdown-driven AI refactor playbook runner with CLI and local web UI for executing structured refactoring workflows.\",\n    \"release_date\": \"2026-05-29\",\n    \"category\": \"workflow agent\",\n    \"sources\": [\"GitHub\"],\n    \"community_quotes\": []\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"gsd-browser\",\n    \"url\": \"https://github.com/open-gsd/gsd-browser\",\n    \"description